n- **I.** The zeros of the function are $x = \\frac{π}{2} + nπ$.\n- **II.** The function has maximum values at $x = \\frac{3π}{2} + 2nπ$.\n- **III.** The range of $y = \\cos x$ is $[- 1, 0]$." :question/worked-solution "Cosine has zeros at x=pi/2+n*pi. At x=3pi/2+2n*pi it is zero, not maximal, and its range is [-1,1]. Only I is true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186176453 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186176049 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4241c7bd-4a2b-556f-be9f-8a884addebb9" :knowledge-point/title "Describing Properties of the Tangent Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06caa996-019d-55b8-9b18-5c983270de02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439615} {:answer/id #uuid "f490172a-f960-5273-937b-4f942ee332ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439616}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f490172a-f960-5273-937b-4f942ee332ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439616} :answer-field/id #uuid "ed2f5e64-32f3-5522-8385-0836cdf1b1de" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440165} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c0e3f19-9827-5a02-9335-759832aa58f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439617} {:answer/id #uuid "25bf5a5c-a822-56a1-a1c2-c6a5ab56d691" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439618}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4c0e3f19-9827-5a02-9335-759832aa58f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218643961